        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Alien Shooter is an top-down shooter video game from Sigma Team created in 2003. It is the first title in the Alien Shooter series to be followed by Alien Shooter: Vengeance. Alien Shooter has two expansions, Fight for Life and The Experiment. They each contain five new levels, including the conclusion to the alien shooter story.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Alien Shooter es un videojuego de disparos en vista cenital creado por Sigma Team en 2003. Es el primer título de la serie Alien Shooter, a la que le siguió Alien Shooter: Vengeance. Alien Shooter tiene dos expansiones, Fight for Life y The Experiment, que contienen cinco niveles nuevos cada una, incluido el desenlace de la historia de los alienígenas.",
          "source": "claude",
